## Configuration

The agent is configured in `astropods.yml`. Key sections:
{{- if .AIGateway}}

### Model

Uses the **Astro AI Gateway** (`astro_ai_gateway: true`) for managed model access — no provider API key required. The platform injects `ASTRO_GATEWAY_URL` and `ASTRO_GATEWAY_API_KEY` at runtime. Run `ast login` to authenticate; the gateway is account-scoped.
{{- else if ne .ModelProvider ""}}

### Model

Self-hosted **{{.ModelProvider}}** provider{{if ne .Model ""}} running `{{.Model}}`{{end}}.
{{- end}}
{{- if gt (len .Integrations) 0}}

### Integrations

| Integration | Type | Environment variable |
|------------|------|---------------------|
{{- range .Integrations}}
{{- if eq . "anthropic"}}
| Anthropic | Model API | `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` |
{{- else if eq . "openai"}}
| OpenAI | Model API | `OPENAI_API_KEY` |
{{- else if eq . "github"}}
| GitHub | Tool | `GITHUB_TOKEN` |
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if gt (len .Knowledge) 0}}

### Knowledge stores

{{- range .Knowledge}}
{{- if eq . "qdrant"}}
- **Qdrant** — vector store for semantic search and embeddings
{{- else if eq . "redis"}}
- **Redis** — key-value store for caching and fast lookups
{{- else if eq . "neo4j"}}
- **Neo4j** — graph database for relationship data
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
